@startuml
title ServiceDesk - Fluxos

actor Client
participant "ServiceDeskController" as C
participant "ServiceDeskService" as S
database "Postgres" as DB

== Criar balcão ==
Client -> C: POST /desks {name, timezone}
C -> S: createDesk(cmd)
S -> DB: INSERT service_desk
DB --> S: created desk
S --> C: desk DTO
C --> Client: 201 Created

== Buscar por id ==
Client -> C: GET /desks/{id}
C -> S: getById(id)
S -> DB: SELECT by id
DB --> S: desk | null
S --> C: desk DTO | NotFound
C --> Client: 200 OK | 404

== Desativar (soft delete) ==
Client -> C: DELETE /desks/{id}
C -> S: deactivate(id)
S -> DB: UPDATE is_active=false
S --> C: ok
C --> Client: 204 No Content
@enduml